@startuml
title Francanglais Platform - Component Diagram
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Contributor
component "CustomTkinter Collector" as UI
component "Dataset service\n(dataset.py)" as DS
component "Audio service\n(audio_utils.py)" as AS
database "dataset.csv" as DB
folder "audio/" as FS
component "Compiler pipeline\n(lexer / classifier / parser)" as CP
component "Future API adapter" as API
actor "Compiler client" as Client

Contributor --> UI
UI --> DS : CRUD entries / stats
UI --> AS : record / attach / play
DS --> DB : CSV read/write
AS --> FS : audio files
Client --> API
API --> CP
CP --> DS : load lexical evidence
API --> UI : optional integration
@enduml
